OL,3,AChart-topping singer and television
OL,4,Ahost Lena Martell dies aged 86
OL,5,
OL,6,FScottish singer and Broadway performer
OL,7,FLena Martell has died at the age of 86.
OL,9,FShe was the first solo Scottish female
OL,10,Fsinger to top the UK singles chart with
OL,11,Fher cover of the song One Day at a Time
OL,12,Fin 1979.
OL,14,FBorn Helen Thomson in Glasgow, Martell
OL,15,Frecorded a number of albums over the
OL,16,Fyears and performed in New York and Las
OL,17,FVegas alongside Frank Sinatra, Sammy
OL,18,FDavis Jr and Barbara Streisand.
