OL,4,Ahost Lena Martell dies aged 86
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe became a familiar entertainment
OL,7,Fstar in the 1970s when she hosted her
OL,8,Fown BBC prime time television show for
OL,9,Fabout a decade.
